  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#other-metadata-names\r\n\r\n> Wiki MetaExtensions page ... Status One of the following: Proposed ... Ratified ... Discontinued\r\n\r\nThe definitions given for those three status terms refer to a peer review process. Is that happening? The [Wiki page](https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/MetaExtensions) `Status` column does not have any of those terms, but has \"Proposal\", \"Incomplete proposal\", and \"Unendorsed\". Can the standard and this Wiki page it refers to be brought into conformity?",
